{
  "file_id": "3592",
  "text_count": 50,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "There's no way that has anything\nto do with the badge.",
      "_offset": 20,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "That's it! The Numemon boss has\nTakeru's badge!",
      "_offset": 75,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "What?!",
      "_offset": 123,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "You're not saying... that Takeru's\nbadge is actually that p-p-poo...",
      "_offset": 130,
      "_length": 68,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "N-No! That's not what I meant!",
      "_offset": 199,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "You see, Takeru's badge was\nactually a present from my dad.",
      "_offset": 230,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "Takeru loves ice cream,\nso my dad thought he'd like a\nbadge shaped like one.",
      "_offset": 290,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "What a nice dad!",
      "_offset": 367,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "I get it! So that Numemon boss\nmistook it for a lucky white poop!",
      "_offset": 384,
      "_length": 65,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Let's go find the boss!",
      "_offset": 450,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Hey, do you know where the Numemon\nboss is?",
      "_offset": 474,
      "_length": 43,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Hmm? I dunno 'bout complicated\nstuff like that. I just live\n'round here.",
      "_offset": 518,
      "_length": 72,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "But he should be somewhere 'round\nthe sewer.",
      "_offset": 591,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "By the way, missy, would you mind\naccompanying me to...",
      "_offset": 636,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "I do N-O-T want to take a sewer\nbath!",
      "_offset": 692,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "There he is!",
      "_offset": 730,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "He's all squirmy, like the other\nNumemon. I'm definitely getting a\nbad vibe from him.",
      "_offset": 743,
      "_length": 85,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Nunuuu! Rude! Whaddya mean by\nthat?",
      "_offset": 829,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "That badge! It's mine! Can't you\ngive it back?",
      "_offset": 865,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "This symbol has been passed down\nby boss Numemon for generations! \nAre you trying to start a fight?",
      "_offset": 912,
      "_length": 99,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "No way.",
      "_offset": 1012,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "You're horrible!",
      "_offset": 1020,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "It's such an obvious lie.",
      "_offset": 1037,
      "_length": 25,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Aren't you the boss? Don't you\nhave any shame at all, lying like\nthat?",
      "_offset": 1063,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I got it from my dad when we were\nseparated. There's only one like\nit... so give it back!",
      "_offset": 1134,
      "_length": 89,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Nunuuu! I can't hear you when you\ntalk so quietly! Wahahaha!",
      "_offset": 1224,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Now I'm angry!",
      "_offset": 1285,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Patamon!",
      "_offset": 1300,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "I'll get it back for you, no\nmatter what!",
      "_offset": 1309,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Do you really think so, kiddo?",
      "_offset": 1351,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "We'll back you up, Patamon!",
      "_offset": 1382,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "We did it, Takeru! We got your\nbadge back!",
      "_offset": 1410,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Thank you, Patamon! Thanks, guys!",
      "_offset": 1453,
      "_length": 33,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Well, you're like a little brother\nto all of us, Takeru.",
      "_offset": 1487,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "There's that disgrace of a boss!\nHaven't you taken some time to\nthink about what you've done?",
      "_offset": 1544,
      "_length": 93,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "Yes! I'll be good!",
      "_offset": 1638,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Will you really?",
      "_offset": 1657,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Please accept this as a token of\nmy regret, I beg of you!",
      "_offset": 1674,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Can we really have this?",
      "_offset": 1732,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Take it, take it!",
      "_offset": 1757,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Thank you, Boss!",
      "_offset": 1775,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "If you would like, based on \ninformation we've recieved thus\nfar, I can locate the Numemon.",
      "_offset": 1792,
      "_length": 91,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Please, Koushirou.",
      "_offset": 1884,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "That's strange. My computer seems\nto be malfunctioning...",
      "_offset": 1903,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Hurry up, Koushirou!",
      "_offset": 1961,
      "_length": 20,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "It's my fault.",
      "_offset": 1982,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Please don't panic. Let me try\nrestarting it...",
      "_offset": 1997,
      "_length": 47,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "It's because we've spent so long\nin this sewer, right?",
      "_offset": 2045,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "Oh, no, it's just because of a\nprogram error. Please don't worry\nabout it.",
      "_offset": 2100,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "Really? That's a relief.",
      "_offset": 2175,
      "_length": 24,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}